    "id": "",
    "ja": ""
  },
  "impact": {
    "en": "Newton's Principia Mathematica unified terrestrial and celestial mechanics under the law of universal gravitation, transforming physics into a mathematical science. His work dominated scientific thought for over two centuries and remains foundational to classical mechanics.",
